      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `ff83856b7d26398a09139cad80851e83d84f79827a8b35848ef656cdd38c1f27--victims-of-crime-indigenous-status-selected-states-and-territories.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2016\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | f7a00834aab2e1c8b2404634e15e72b558c3dd55eac0cf20638ca300cb2f13fe | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | a12d43d946b2e1772d7dfa7d9c6db518f92075084ed1bc8026096cc661383632 | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | eccad9810b0d53a099a5257cf9390cc66313c04fa484a25c3569fa359ff920d5 | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | 0b20a5a7b9949d5ddf9306e14d31a380188f74f82a96453e00a186efabe3706f | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | 4d80b9a7839624455073ee09a91bd04adeb89b3e5dabc730f0e3cdb5c52e0652 | missing |\n| \"Table 20\" | 6e299a1ffe18ce1358c033b984ed7ec6c8962fd743c8e61e841f573c74c5d095 | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | da2dcd87d2163dc082a2b4e10b45f827c5b2bee3a84d1fa7280f05966d1b76d6 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 5de1224ada97d7da2894a8ea69bf98cccac94d228300073ff2247026dffd277d | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
